      "message": "docs(decisions): path kernel K0 design record\n\nThe design record of the path kernel (#4023): the six stage types,\nthe laws of #4023 as checks for the K7 suite, the map of the present\n2D operations to the stages, the migration order, and the Outside\nstart shape of #3934 in kernel terms. Design only; no code.\n\nFixes #4024\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
