      "message": "docs(decisions): path kernel K0 revision 2 - one-go replacement\n\nTake in the maintainer's answers on PR #4030: the one-go replacement of\n2D milling and 3D Pocket on the side branch side/path-kernel behind one\nswitch, the kernel as its own crate (camcraft-pathkernel recommended),\nthe roadmap of all 49 operation kinds in six phases, the fit check of\nthe other families, and what phase 1 keeps open. #3750's golden\nrecords are reused as the baseline; its move on main is dropped.\n\nFixes #4024\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
