        "date": "2026-11-25T16:48:12Z"
      },
      "message": "docs(decisions): path kernel K0 revision 3 - the maintainer's answers\n\nRecord the maintainer's answers of 2026-11-25 (\"Yes, start\"): the crate\nname camcraft-pathkernel, Bore and Thread in phase 1 (16 kinds), turning\nas phase 3, the side-branch rule and protection, one heavy run before the\nswitch-over, his approval of the switch-over PR, and the five phase-1\nissues #4034-#4038. The work plane and the tool shape stay open from the\nstart for turning. No question is open.\n\nFixes #4024\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
